OL,3,GNEWSAThe 'selfless decision' that saved
OL,4,Aour boy's life
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a teenage organ donor say
OL,7,Fit has been a "true honour" to watch
OL,8,Fthe little boy who received her liver
OL,9,Fthrive 10 years on.
OL,11,FMiriam Lee, 17, from Kettering,
OL,12,FNorthamptonshire, died from sudden
OL,13,Fcardiac arrest in 2016. Her liver was
OL,14,Fgiven to 11-month-old Ollie Jolliff,
OL,15,Ffrom Poole, Dorset, who urgently needed
OL,16,Fa transplant due to a genetic
OL,17,Fcondition.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,367,360,200,160,0,100
