OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAThe 'selfless decision' that saved
OL,4,Aour boy's life
OL,5,
OL,6,FOllie's brother Kieran died from the
OL,7,Fsame condition at the age of four.
OL,8,FTheir mother Hannah said they received
OL,9,Fword of a possible donor for Ollie on
OL,10,Fwhat would have been Kieran's 10th
OL,11,Fbirthday.
OL,13,FMiriam's parents, Nicola and David,
OL,14,Fsaid: "It has been a true honour to see
OL,15,FOllie grow up. It's helped us with our
OL,16,Fgrief, that something positive has come
OL,17,Fout of something awful."
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
